        {
          "text": "Ng'ata niny ghwadeas Malkiya, was siyagi was gearnoocheanda lagheanga siguura dahaabu, ea ghwahita gheeda fuga gadiyeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, duuksiinyi sea fuga ageakshachi duukusa dooshta siida haw ea ghushadeeda ghooriida diyeada bea ghwanooda ghamarda. ",
